WORLD UPDATE BREAKDOWN
-global updates
-areas
-zones

loop queue
  player count > 0? (do we have any players logged on?)
  process any global update
  loop areas
    players in area > 0?
    process area-wide updates
    loop area zones
      players in zone > 0?
      process zone updates

CLIENT INPUT
------------
The goal with client inputs is to make them well-structured but as lite as possible. With client prediction and server reconciliation in mind, having inputs be arrays may be best. (ex. [1, 45, 32, 23] etc.)

